 <text type="manuscript">
  <body>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="hun.00011.001.jpg" type="recto"/>
    <note type="authorial" place="top" rend="circled">follow copy punctuation &amp;c strictly</note>
    <note type="authorial" place="top" rend="circled">Personal</note>
    <note type="archival" place="left" hand="#h02"><hi rend="underline">cxxx</hi><lb/>22.50</note>
   <lg type="poem">
    <head type="main" rend="underline"><add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">Queries</add> To My Seventieth Year.</head>
     <l>Approaching, nearing, curious,</l>
     <l>Thou dim <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">half-visible</del> <add place="above" seq="2">uncertain</add></subst> spectre, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">hovering, close,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">bringest</add></subst></l>
    <l><del rend="overstrike">Bringest</del> <subst><add place="above" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" xml:id="a002" seq="2">bringest</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">thou</del> <add place="above" seq="2">thou</add></subst> life or death? <del rend="overstrike">Wilt stir <lb/>the waters yet?</del></l>
    
<!--  BEGIN HERE; I'LL BE DOING A TRANSPOSE FOR THESE NEXT FOUR LINES.   -->
    
    <metamark function="group" rend="bracket-left" spanTo="#s001"/>
     <l><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">Wilt</del><add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" seq="3" xml:id="a003">Or haply</add></subst> cut me short for good&#8212;or <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">leave</del><add place="above" seq="2">leave</add></subst><lb/> me here <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">repeating?</del><add place="above" seq="2">as now?</add></subst></l>
     <l>(Here, fretful, parrot&#11840;like and old,<lb/> <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a004">with crack'd voice</add> harping, <del rend="overstrike">and</del> screeching;)</l>
    <metamark function="group" rend="bracket-left" spanTo="#s001"/>
     <l>Strength, weakness, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a005">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a005">blindness,</add> more paralysis and <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">heavier?</del><add place="above" seq="2">heavier?</add></subst></l>
     <l>Or placid skies and sun, and wreaths from<lb/> foreign lands?&#8212;wilt stir the waters yet?</l>
    <anchor xml:id="s001"/>
     <l><del rend="overstrike">Passing me <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a006"></metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a006">on</add> to <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">further</del><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">senile</add></del><del rend="overstrike" seq="5"><add place="above" seq="4">contracting me</add></del></subst> time thro' thy twelve<lb/> months?</del></l>
    <delSpan rend="overstrike" spanTo="#d001"/>
     <l>(As we grow old we narrow on <choice><orig>our-<lb/> selves</orig><reg>ourselves<lb/> </reg></choice> concentrating,</l>
     <l>Something to us unspeakably pensive in<lb/> our own <del rend="overstrike">age</del>, bleakness, sorrs, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a007">age,</add>)</l>
    <addSpan rend="pasteon" spanTo="#a008"/>
     <l>Or <del rend="overstrike">summary</del> ending all, with unnerv'd<lb/> hand and accent&#8212;immobility indeed,</l>
     <l>With immobility indeed with buried heart<lb/> and brain<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">?</del><add seq="2">,</add></subst> and hearse and grave.</l>
    <anchor xml:id="d001"/>
   </lg>
    <signed rend="underline">Walt Whitman</signed>
    <anchor xml:id="a008"/>
   
